## Goal

Build a minimal web interface for the existing DailyCheckIn contract deployed on Monad Testnet.

## User Flow

Connect wallet
→ detect Monad Testnet
→ read check-in status
→ submit checkIn()
→ display transaction result

## Tasks

- [ ] Create the frontend project
- [ ] Connect Bitget Wallet or MetaMask
- [ ] Display the connected wallet address
- [ ] Detect Chain ID 10143
- [ ] Provide a network error message
- [ ] Load the existing DailyCheckIn contract
- [ ] Read checkInCount(address)
- [ ] Read canCheckIn(address)
- [ ] Call checkIn()
- [ ] Display Pending status
- [ ] Display Success status
- [ ] Display Failed status
- [ ] Display the transaction hash
- [ ] Add a MonadVision transaction link
- [ ] Add screenshots
- [ ] Update README to v0.2

## Contract

Network: Monad Testnet

