Contract address:

0xcB4993E563a4C892d945277C53a39ee6885097E0

## Security Constraints

- Do not expose private keys or seed phrases
- Do not commit secrets or .env files
- Do not use real funds
- Do not automatically sign transactions
- Do not change the deployed contract without approval

## Acceptance Criteria

- The wallet can connect successfully
- The page identifies the correct network
- The page displays the correct wallet address
- The page reads contract state
- The user can manually confirm checkIn()
- The result can be verified on MonadVision
